entries.def:
περι-βάλλω 
[in LXX chiefly for כָּסָה pi., also for לָבַשׁ, עָטָה, etc. ;] 
to throw around or over, put on or over; 
__(a) of siege or defen­sive works: χάρακά σοι, Luk.19.43 (WH, mg.; παρεμβ-, WH, txt.); 
__(b) of clothing, to put on, wrap about, clothe with: with accusative of thing(s), Luk.23.11 with accusative of person(s), Mat.25.36, 38; 25.43; with dupl. accusative (not cl.; Bl., § 34, 4), Jhn.19.2 pf.…
